OL,3,GNEWSAMum pleads guilty to killing her
OL,4,Athree children
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mother who admitted killing her three
OL,7,Fchildren at their home wept in court as
OL,8,Fdetails of their deaths were read out.
OL,10,FThe bodies of Fares Bash, seven, Joury
OL,11,FBash, three, and nine-month-old
OL,12,FMohammed Bash were discovered on Blaise
OL,13,FWalk in Sea Mills, Bristol, on 18
OL,14,FFebruary 2024.
OL,16,FAppearing at Bristol Crown Court
OL,17,Fearlier, Yasmeen Ali, 44, admitted
OL,18,Fthree charges of manslaughter. She is
OL,19,Fdue to be sentenced later.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
