OL,3,GNEWSAMum pleads guilty to killing her
OL,4,Athree children
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn inquest into the deaths was
OL,7,Fpreviously told the three children died
OL,8,Fof knife wounds, with injuries to their
OL,9,Fchests and necks. Fares Bash also
OL,10,Fshowed possible signs of asphyxia.
